pwm1:m:so i did a lot of testing. The ID marketplace works fine i guess with seal transaction appearing after listing.  I can seal them. For credits when you list the listing transaction and seal tab that used to come alive just flashes and dissappears. The transaction is broadcasted and you can see in the mempool however does not show in the wallet. Also transfers are also not showing in the other wallet. I tried with multiple ones. The holder count is also not increasing as it might be connected. Another thing i noticed credit POW is showing 15% but when you try to mint satys minted out. Some listings that i attempted not showing in unsealed marketplace as well. I tried with two different laptops windows and mac and google pixel and iphone same issue. I have asked my friend from another geographical location to try as well. Will update. all are on mempool confirmed transactions so balances across wallets holder count etc should change right? The listing goes through but cant seal as the tab disappears. Also i figured out how to reverse low fee transactions through unisat utxo tool. Unlock them and send them back. It worked fine.just send them back to yourself and fees was like 3 sats to reverse 0.1. I reversed 11 of my mint ones which had large chunks of btc stuck.